#: includes/class-stmc-admin.php:229
msgid "The withdrawal function required EU-wide since 19 June 2026: a public page reachable for guests, pre-filled for logged-in customers, with merchant notification, customer receipt and a full management screen under WooCommerce."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-stmc-admin.php:232
msgid "Bundle discounts"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-stmc-admin.php:233
msgid "A percentage off the cart once it holds enough different products. Needs no coupon form, reaches PayPal as a real discount, and tells customers how close they are to the next step."
msgstr ""

