msgid "Payment-dependent required fields"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-stmc-admin.php:249
msgid "Invoice purchase may ask for a phone number where prepayment does not. Checked again on the server, so the rule holds even if the browser is lied to."
msgstr ""

