msgid "Checkout field editor"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-stmc-admin.php:257
msgid "Add your own fields in 22 field types, and move, rename, widen or hide the fields of WooCommerce, with conditions, checks and a preview of your layout."
msgstr ""

